   "tag": "h1",
   "text": "Past Lives: A Journey Through Memory Lane",
   "section": "comp-m04zcdxw"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Updated: Jul 15, 2025",
   "section": "comp-m04zcdxw"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The concept of past lives, embedded in various spiritual traditions, suggests that our souls",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "undergo multiple lifetimes, carrying experiences and karmic imprints that influence our",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "current existence and future lives.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Many believe that we choose each incarnation which presents us with the opportunity to learn specific lessons that the soul must learn. These lessons may involve themes of love, forgiveness, and understanding of other peoples’ actions in our lives.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "People may recognize past lives through familiarity and a sense of recognition in certain places, unexplained phobias rooted in past traumas, strong feelings linked to specific people or situations, repeated relationship patterns that reflect current unsolved issues.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The exploration of past lives can help us heal emotionally through processing unresolved feelings and break free from limiting beliefs and invites us to consider the convolutions of our existence beyond the present life. Exploring into past lives can offer valuable lessons and deepen our understanding of the soul’s journey through time. This experience can be life changing.",
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Are you ready to do the quantum jump?",
   "section": ""
  },
